  "body": "An outstanding opportunity to secure a brand-new standalone home in the highly sought-after suburb of Browns Bay on Auckland's North Shore.\r\n\r\nWith Title and CCC issued, these modern homes offer peace of mind, practical layouts and a convenient lifestyle in a fantastic family-friendly location.\r\n\r\nPositioned directly across the road from Sherwood School, the properties are approximately a one-minute walk to school, making them an ideal choice for families looking for convenience and quality living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Brand-new standalone homes with contemporary design\r\n* Choice of 3 or 4 bedrooms to suit different family needs\r\n* Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas\r\n* Modern bathrooms and quality finishes\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Low-maintenance outdoor areas\r\n* Excellent school zoning\r\n* Close to Browns Bay Beach, shops, cafés, parks and public transport  \r\n\r\nAvailable Options:\r\nLot 2 & Lot 3\r\n4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage\r\n153m² Land Area | 120m² Floor Area\r\nLot 4\r\n3 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage\r\n156m² Land Area | 117m² Floor Area\r\n\r\nSchool Zones:\r\n* Sherwood Primary School\r\n* Northcross Intermediate\r\n* Long Bay College  \r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, growing family, professional or investor, these homes offer an excellent opportunity to secure a modern property in a popular North Shore location.\r\n\r\nThe developer is motivated and keen to sell - all reasonable offers are welcome!\r\n\r\nLot 1 has already been sold, so don't miss your chance to secure one of the remaining homes.\r\n\r\nÃ?Æ'°Ã?…¸\"Ã?…¾ Contact Alana today for further information, current pricing or to arrange a private viewing.\r\nBring your offer and make your move to Browns Bay!",
